# Per-instance WebTransport advertise address (explicit, no computation needed).
# This is the address GC tells clients to connect to for this specific MH pod.
# IPv4 literal, NOT "localhost": under WSL2 mirrored networking a host browser
# resolves "localhost" to IPv6 ::1, but the dev port publisher (podman
# rootlessport) binds IPv4 127.0.0.1 only. QUIC/WebTransport to ::1 then gets
# no reply (UDP has no TCP-style happy-eyeballs fallback) and the signaling
# transport times out. Devloop-container runs override this via deploy.sh's
# DT_HOST_GATEWAY_IP render (render_env_overlay); this default serves the host-browser/host-env-test path.
MH_WEBTRANSPORT_ADVERTISE_ADDRESS=https://127.0.0.1:4434
